        "text": "According to Petitioners, congress concluded that the prompt removal of aliens convicted of serious felonies is essential to the Nation's ability to control its borders."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Petitioners",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "1af832f80e08b1353f2f3283b8b038009c165c1ffa36ab0520c637ed7c4c6607",
